  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Secretary-General launched the Sustainable Energy for All Initiative-SE4ALL to mobilize action from all sectors of society in support of three interlinked objectives to be achieved by 2030 providing universal access to modern energy services; doubling the global rate of improvement in energy efficiency; and doubling the share of renewable energy in the global energy mix.</narrative>
